    <h2 class="govuk-heading-m"{% if termsWithAnchors %} id="monitoring-your-activity" tabindex="-1"{% endif %}>Remember your activity is recorded and may be monitored</h2>
    <p class="govuk-body">HMPPS Digital Services keeps an audit trail of your activity. Your activity may be monitored and investigated where inappropriate or unauthorised use is suspected.</p>
    <p class="govuk-body">HMPPS can see:</p>
    <ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
      <li>what information you've searched for or viewed</li>
      <li>what you've created or changed</li>
      <li>when you accessed it</li>
    </ul>

